        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open Slowth from the blocking notification. If the banner disappears, find it in Notification Center. During recording, use Settings → Notifications → Screen Sharing → Allow Notifications. This optional switch applies to all apps."
